* AD4021 ADC Front End
VVDD VDD 0 1.8
VVIO VIO 0 1.8
VREF REF 0 5
VIN IN 0 1

* Conversion clock (1 MSPS, 50ns pulse width)
VCNV CNV 0 PULSE(0 1.8 0 1n 1n 50n 1u)

* Serial clock (50 MHz, continuous)
VSCK SCK 0 PULSE(0 1.8 0 1n 1n 10n 20n)

* Serial data input (tied low for single ADC operation)
VSDI SDI 0 0

* AD4021 Instance
* Pin order: IN+ IN- REF VDD VIO GND CNV SDI SCK SDO
X1 IN 0 REF VDD VIO 0 CNV SDI SCK OUT AD4021

* Analysis directive
.tran 0 5u 0 10n

.end
